  {
   "n": 14,
   "type": "MSQ",
   "section": "Technical",
   "tags": "Technical • COMPUTER SCIENCE & IT • +2 / -0.66",
   "html": "<p>Let <<em>M</em>> be the encoding of a Turing Machine M.<br />\nWhich of the following languages are decidable?</p>",
   "options": [
    {
     "key": "A",
     "html": "<p><img align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" src=\"media/f2/f2a28721477f46366c3b.png\" /></p>"
